{"id": 593290, "slug": "instruments-of-destruction", "name": "Instruments of Destruction", "name_original": "Instruments of Destruction", "description": "<p>Instruments of Destruction features an advanced physics-based destruction system.  You can demolish every structure in the game piece by piece.  In addition, every object you see in the game world--save for small decorative plants and rocks--is part of the physics system.  Each element of the world interacts with each other and together they create a physical, visceral world to play with.Build Your Vehicle<br />\nBuild a vehicle your way, with an ever-expanding array of parts and pieces.  Using an intuitive vehicle construction system that also lets you customize your vehicles&#39; appearance and controls, you&#39;ll always have fun creating your next awesome invention.<br />\nFrom simple splitters to advanced joints, a variety of parts slowly unlock as you play through the game, and each unlocks countless new possibilities.</p>\n<p>While some vehicles will perform better than others in accomplishing your objectives, it&#39;s always a bit more fun to get creative and go a little off script.  Optional bonus challenges and objectives will reward more creative builders and add more replayability.</p>", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2022-03-02", "tba": false, "updated": "2026-08-29T16:54:25", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/e33/e33584d1d6c8946ed6a35feca6452835.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/2de/2de68afe170b51cccd807abf3bcfedbb.jpg", "website": "", "rating": 3.67, "rating_top": 4, "ratings": [{"id": 4, "title": "recommended", "count": 4, "percent": 44.44}, {"id": 5, "title": "exceptional", "count": 2, "percent": 22.22}, {"id": 3, "title": "meh", "count": 2, "percent": 22.22}, {"id": 1, "title": "skip", "count": 1, "percent": 11.11}], "reactions": {}, "added": 85, "added_by_status": {"yet": 5, "owned": 56, "beate